    {
      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_aef87615",
      "@type": "Scene",
      "instance_name": "question_scene",
      "label": "man posing with text overlay",
      "description": "An older man in a light blue hoodie is seated at a wooden table, holding a pen over an open notebook, looking directly at the camera. The scene is framed with text at the top and bottom that reads 'if i identify as a dog' and 'can i poop in your yard?', creating a humorous and provocative context. The man appears to be in a neutral or slightly confused expression, suggesting he is being used as a visual punchline for the absurd question.",
